{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_0e35eafb93bbd253016a90356f1ef487d29514c6f84eca5d3c","text":"FINDINGS\n\n- `src/workspace.rs:742`: `append_agent_line` drops duplicate transcript lines, but `request_feature_done_confirmation` at `src/workspace.rs:782` always appends the same `\"work-leaf: is this feature done? yes/no\"` string after each `ReviewComplete` path at `src/workspace.rs:711`. After a user answers `no`, or answers `yes` then later reopens and completes another review, the session status is set back to awaiting confirmation but the new prompt is not appended at the end of the chat. The chat can be highlighted without visibly asking the required yes/no question for the latest review cycle.\n\n- Missing required real-agent verification. The patch affects agent-facing review completion and terminal chat behavior, but the recorded validation only shows `cargo test --test ui_harness --test workspace`. This would be resolved by reporting an exact real configured backend scenario and visible result for review completion prompting, `yes` local close, and later chat reopen, or by reporting the exact pre-agent blocker from the required bounded smoke check.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null,"delivery":null},"threadId":"01a0434e-39d0-76d2-840b-4bb14335d058","turnId":"01a0434f-67ec-7a43-a9c8-7b7e43c48e2a","completedAtMs":1787835763259},"emittedAtMs":1787835763259}
