{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_0c1fcc85c5704ee9016a9035909f3087d2b855c746bd8cb4fd","text":"The current applied code confirms the reviewer’s first finding: duplicate transcript suppression can hide later identical confirmation prompts. I’m changing the confirmation line to include the reviewed commit hash, which makes each review cycle visibly distinct while preserving the same yes/no instruction.","phase":"commentary","memoryCitation":null,"delivery":null},"threadId":"01a04347-4439-7793-843e-fa41147c6505","turnId":"01a04350-e722-77c1-af8a-9141e0fbf0fb","completedAtMs":1787835800267},"emittedAtMs":1787835800267}
