{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_049a63ca830c1e34016a9035d7724487d285a838b8092eed91","text":"@work-leaf edit FIX infer visual yank text collection so the visual mode patch compiles\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: src/ui.rs\n@@\n fn selected_text(lines: &[String], selection: &VisualSelection) -> String {\n     let mut selected = Vec::new();\n     for row in selected_row_range(selection) {\n         let Some(line) = lines.get(row) else {\n             continue;\n         };\n         if let Some((start, end)) = selected_columns(selection, row, line_char_len(line)) {\n-            selected.push(line.chars().skip(start).take(end - start).collect());\n+            selected.push(line.chars().skip(start).take(end - start).collect::<String>());\n         }\n     }\n     selected.join(\"\\n\")\n }\n*** End Patch\n@work-leaf end","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null,"delivery":null},"threadId":"01a04347-1d9c-76c2-ac69-dc636dc8b712","turnId":"01a04352-33ef-7252-bfd3-0ca08f660bda","completedAtMs":1787835866526},"emittedAtMs":1787835866527}
