{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_067fd4bb33581155016a903654590887d290f1e124e3586b5e","text":"The adapters defer `Esc` while in visual mode, same as insert/prompt, so a bare `Esc` still has a finish path through pending escape dispatch. That does not look like the main risk after reading the input code.","phase":"commentary","memoryCitation":null,"delivery":null},"threadId":"01a04352-f47e-7d50-8555-36919dab4f2b","turnId":"01a04353-1aef-7852-bfde-1ea7525289cd","completedAtMs":1787835989485},"emittedAtMs":1787835989485}
