{"method":"item/started","params":{"item":{"type":"userMessage","id":"01a04359-2c02-7691-aced-c69c2fcfc87c","clientId":null,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The original agent has responded to the findings for commit 958d0887669e2c5fa20adce9aad75a1128a71b7b.\n@work-leaf read src/ui.rs tests/ui_harness.rs tests/terminal_ui.rs\n\norchestrator:\nsent file text to user-1: src/ui.rs, tests/terminal_ui.rs, tests/ui_harness.rs\n\nagent follow-up from user-1:\nI’m reading the refreshed mediated bundle for the cumulative patch state. The fixes are in `src/ui.rs`: map left visual anchors to rendered rows and clear visual state on mouse navigation.\n\n@work-leaf edit FIX visual selection anchors and clears stale highlights when pane focus changes by mouse\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: src/ui.rs\n@@\n             UiKey::MouseClick { column, row } => {\n                 self.pending = None;\n+                if self.mode.is_visual() {\n+                    self.clear_visual_selection();\n+                }\n                 return self.handle_mouse_click(column, row);\n             }\n@@\n         match pane {\n             PaneFocus::Left => {\n-                let row = self.control_selected.min(lines.len() - 1);\n+                let row = self.left_control_selected_render_row().min(lines.len() - 1);\n                 VisualPosition { row, column: 0 }\n             }\n             PaneFocus::Right => {\n@@\n         lines\n     }\n+\n+    fn left_control_selected_render_row(&self) -> usize {\n+        if self.control_selected == 0 {\n+            return 0;\n+        }\n+\n+        let Some(selected_agent_index) = self.control_selected_agent_index() else {\n+            return 0;\n+        };\n+        let mut row = 1;\n+        for agent_index in self.visible_agent_indices() {\n+            if agent_index == selected_agent_index {\n+                return row;\n+            }\n+            row += 1 + self.left_agent_metadata_row_count(&self.agents[agent_index]);\n+        }\n+        0\n+    }\n+\n+    fn left_agent_metadata_row_count(&self, agent: &AgentListEntry) -> usize {\n+        usize::from(!agent.modified_files.is_empty())\n+            + usize::from(!agent.conflicting_agents.is_empty())\n+            + usize::from(!agent.depends_on.is_empty())\n+            + usize::from(!agent.depended_on_by.is_empty())\n+    }\n \n     fn right_text(&self, right_content: &str) -> Vec<Spans<'static>> {\n*** Update File: tests/terminal_ui.rs\n@@\n fn visual_selection_highlights_and_yanks_right_pane_lines() {\n     let mut ui = TerminalUi::new(80, 12);\n@@\n     assert!(ui.render_screen(\"alpha\\nbeta\\nchat> \").starts_with(\"\\u{1b}]52;c;\"));\n }\n \n+#[test]\n+fn left_visual_selection_starts_on_selected_agent_row_after_metadata() {\n+    let mut ui = TerminalUi::new(120, 20);\n+    let chat_a = AgentId::new(\"chat-a\").unwrap();\n+    let chat_b = AgentId::new(\"chat-b\").unwrap();\n+    ui.add_agent(\n+        AgentListEntry::new(chat_a.clone(), \"parser\")\n+            .with_modified_file(\"src/parser.rs\")\n+            .with_conflicting_agent(chat_b.clone()),\n+    );\n+    ui.add_agent(AgentListEntry::new(chat_b.clone(), \"docs\"));\n+    ui.select_agent(&chat_b).unwrap();\n+\n+    ui.handle_key(UiKey::Char('V'));\n+    ui.handle_key(UiKey::Char('Y'));\n+\n+    assert!(ui.clipboard_text().contains(\"docs chat-b\"));\n+    assert!(!ui.clipboard_text().contains(\"files: src/parser.rs\"));\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn mouse_click_clears_visual_selection_highlight() {\n+    let mut ui = TerminalUi::new(80, 12);\n+\n+    ui.handle_key(UiKey::CtrlW);\n+    ui.handle_key(UiKey::Char('l'));\n+    ui.render_screen(\"alpha\\nbeta\\nchat> \");\n+    ui.handle_key(UiKey::Char('V'));\n+    ui.handle_key(UiKey::Char('k'));\n+    assert!(\n+        ui.render_screen(\"alpha\\nbeta\\nchat> \")\n+            .contains(\"\\u{1b}[7mbeta\\u{1b}[0m\")\n+    );\n+\n+    ui.handle_key(UiKey::MouseClick { column: 30, row: 3 });\n+\n+    assert_eq!(ui.mode(), UiMode::Command);\n+    assert!(\n+        !ui.render_screen(\"alpha\\nbeta\\nchat> \")\n+            .contains(\"\\u{1b}[7mbeta\\u{1b}[0m\")\n+    );\n+}\n+\n fn strip_ansi(input: &str) -> String {\n*** End Patch\n@work-leaf end\n\norchestrator:\napplied patch from user-1: FIX visual selection anchors and clears stale highlights when pane focus changes by mouse; commit=a0580ef3f5cba942fdca8ecad51a40d90fb79cca; files=src/ui.rs, tests/terminal_ui.rs\n\nagent follow-up from user-1:\n@work-leaf locks run target Cargo.lock -- cargo test visual --all-targets --all-features && printf 'Reply exactly with WORK_LEAF_REAL_AGENT_OK and do not modify files.\\n' | codex --cd \"$PWD\" --sandbox read-only --ask-for-approval never exec --color never --json - \n\n\norchestrator:\nran command for user-1: status=0 paths=Cargo.lock, target command=cargo test visual --all-targets --all-features && printf 'Reply exactly with WORK_LEAF_REAL_AGENT_OK and do not modify files.\\n' | codex --cd \"$PWD\" --sandbox read-only --ask-for-approval never exec --color never --json -\n\nagent follow-up from user-1:\n@work-leaf done\n\norchestrator:\nagent user-1 reported done\n\nPlease check the patch again and reply with NO_FINDINGS if resolved, otherwise list remaining FINDINGS. The response may include code patches, verification evidence, real-agent smoke results, or an exact blocker; evaluate that evidence directly and do not require a code patch for a non-code finding. Documentation and plain-text updates are deferred to the linearize agent and must not be reported as remaining patch-agent findings.","text_elements":[]}]},"threadId":"01a04352-f47e-7d50-8555-36919dab4f2b","turnId":"01a04359-2bbe-79a0-8505-d10471c80dee","startedAtMs":1787836312578},"emittedAtMs":1787836312578}
