{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_01d9b965b9a583d1016a90383a513487d2ab9f5c1d6b7ac863","text":"Rewrite base: `c92a0b7060a36eac6db2d869b85e589a7a9480f9`, the parent of the reviewed stack’s first listed commit `e3f2467`. The checkout is detached at `a0580ef`, and the worktree is clean.\n\nProposed final stack: exactly 3 commits, one per listed patch-agent target.\n\n1. `ADD route slash prompts to selected agents so backend commands work from chat input`\n   - Keep behavior from `e3f2467`.\n   - Remove provisional message: `UPDATE apply user-agent patch from user-2`.\n   - Scope: `src/terminal_app.rs`, `src/ui_harness.rs`, `tests/terminal_app.rs`, `tests/ui_harness.rs`.\n\n2. `ADD confirm reviewed patch completion so finished agents close intentionally`\n   - Squash `f53e1da` and `3ed1cda` into one commit.\n   - Remove provisional messages:\n     - `UPDATE apply user-agent patch from user-3`\n     - `UPDATE apply when-review-process-done-patch-agent patch from user-3`\n   - Scope: controller review-completion confirmation state, local yes/no handling, reopening on later chat input, and repeated confirmation visibility.\n   - I expect to add/update small docs text in `docs/architecture.md` and `docs/orchestrator-file-workflow.md` because this changes documented review workflow behavior.\n\n3. `ADD visual pane selection so terminal users can highlight and yank text`\n   - Squash `f631934`, `ea98444`, `958d088`, and `a0580ef` into one commit.\n   - Remove provisional messages:\n     - `UPDATE apply user-agent patch from user-1`\n     - `UPDATE apply user-agent patch from user-1`\n     - `UPDATE apply user-agent patch from user-1`\n     - `UPDATE apply add-vim-visual-mode-both-panes patch from user-1`\n   - Scope: visual, visual-line, and visual-block mode behavior in both panes, yank support, mouse-focus highlight clearing, and UI/terminal tests.\n   - I expect to add/update small terminal docs in `docs/architecture.md`.\n\nPlease accept this rewrite plan or tell me what grouping/message changes you want before I rewrite history.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null,"delivery":null},"threadId":"01a0435a-7a39-7370-aa21-a3cfb67db9cd","turnId":"01a0435a-7a8e-76b2-a3d1-d02fdf4c0b0a","completedAtMs":1787836483003},"emittedAtMs":1787836483003}
