{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_tMNmSBszbVERlZY24BeDZUz1","pluginId":null,"scriptPath":null,"command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc 'git show --stat --oneline --decorate c93847c 9459610 84550b1'","cwd":"/tmp/work-leaf-fair-normal-pilot-runtime-ad016ca/work-leaf/work-leaf-3feature-bench.HiRlMA/repo","processId":"67343","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"unknown","command":"git show --stat --oneline --decorate c93847c 9459610 84550b1"}],"aggregatedOutput":"c93847c ADD selected-agent slash prompt routing for backend commands\n src/terminal_app.rs   | 12 ++++++++++++\n src/ui_harness.rs     | 16 ++++++++++++++++\n tests/terminal_app.rs | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++\n tests/ui_harness.rs   | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 4 files changed, 77 insertions(+)\n9459610 ADD reviewed-feature completion confirmation for intentional closure\n docs/architecture.md               |  29 ++++++----\n docs/orchestrator-file-workflow.md |  12 +++-\n src/lib.rs                         |   3 +-\n src/terminal_app.rs                |  20 +++++--\n src/ui_harness.rs                  |  61 +++++++++++++++++++\n src/workspace.rs                   | 102 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n tests/ui_harness.rs                |  46 +++++++++++++++\n tests/workspace.rs                 | 116 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 8 files changed, 367 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)\n84550b1 (HEAD) ADD terminal visual selection for pane text yanking\n docs/architecture.md |  18 +-\n src/terminal_app.rs  |  24 +++\n src/ui.rs            | 587 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----\n src/ui_harness.rs    |   2 +\n tests/terminal_ui.rs |  66 ++++++\n tests/ui_harness.rs  |  47 +++++\n 6 files changed, 685 insertions(+), 59 deletions(-)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"01a0435a-7a39-7370-aa21-a3cfb67db9cd","turnId":"01a0435b-cbf1-76b1-a13f-62187da006dc","completedAtMs":1787836778017},"emittedAtMs":17